error[E0107]: [CGP-E015] `CanCalculateArea` is a consumer trait and cannot bound an inner provider; a higher-order provider imports its provider trait `AreaCalculator`
  --> src/main.rs:20:33
   |
20 | #[use_provider(InnerCalculator: CanCalculateArea)]
   |                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name the provider trait in the bound, idiomatically `#[use_provider(… : AreaCalculator)]` (not the consumer trait `CanCalculateArea`)

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0107`.
